[00:41.569](Oh nana na na-na- nanana nana)
[00:44.418]Far from dream
{"与梦想相去甚远"}
[00:45.195]Why do we live like
{"为何我们活得"}
[00:46.464]we are a dying breed?
{"像濒危物种般挣扎？"}
[00:48.501]Most of us just keep
{"多数人只是不断"}
[00:49.551]starving for attention
{"渴求着他人关注"}
[00:51.099]We are what we see
{"所见即是我们"}
[00:52.940]if all of us believe in
{"若所有人都信仰"}
[00:54.500]living perfect
{"完美无瑕的生活"}
[00:55.466]Happiness will come unexpected
{"幸福会不期而至"}
[00:57.722]Don't let someone
{"别让任何人"}
[00:58.812]else take it for granted
{"将其视为理所当然"}
